..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name        : TRANS.SET.VALUES.FILES
.. Autor           : fwester
.. Verantwortlich  : fwester
.. Kontrolle       : cl
.. Funktion        : Simuliert Radio button group fuer die Dateibereichswahl.
.. Ablauf          : Feldaustritts-EFOP
..
.. Functionality   : Simulates a radio button group for the selection of files.
.. Program flow    : Field exit efop
...Includes        :
.. include sy/TRANS.SET.PROTECT
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.copy M|fopstd   = G|evtvar = "fopstd"
.copy M|fopow    = G|evtvar = "fopow"
.copy M|foparb   = G|evtvar = "foparb"
.copy M|fopone   = G|evtvar = "fopone"
.copy M|foptrans = G|evtvar = "foptrans"
..
.. Will set protections and reset values below if a new file area is selected
.continue END ? _M|lastfop = "" & M|lastfop = G|evtvar
.formula M|lastfop = G|evtvar
.formula M|category = "OPTION3"
.input "sy/TRANS.SET.PROTECT"
..****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
